Hi Avery,

New in Ashby Analytics: a one-page pipeline health view built for founders and hiring managers rather than recruiters.

For every open role you see: candidates per stage, days in stage against your targets, pass-through rates, and where candidates drop out. Roles that have gone quiet are flagged.

Also new:
- Weekly hiring digest to Slack or email, per role or per department
- Source effectiveness: which channels produce hires, not just applicants
- Interviewer load balancing to spread interviews across the team

See the dashboard: https://ashbyhq.com/analytics/pipeline-health

